<object id="legend" label="Legend&lt;br&gt;Official Azure2 / AWS4 catalog service icons; plain boxes where a service icon is inapplicable.&lt;br&gt;Boundaries = deployment or software-system domains.&lt;br&gt;Solid filled arrow = request / forwarding action; dashed filled arrow = auxiliary authentication / role query.&lt;br&gt;Normal response is folded into request labels. VPN legs 9a/9b are traffic routing.&lt;br&gt;No additional behavior is implied by icon placement or line routing." annotationKind="legend"><mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" annotationKind="legend" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=12;fillColor=#F4F7F9;strokeColor=#90A4AE;"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1820" width="1500" height="220" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object>
